<body background="images/Repeatla2.gif" class="BodyA">


<div style="position:absolute;top:35;left:-4;z-index:-1"><img align="left" border="0" src="images/grn_curve.gif" alt='' WIDTH="40" HEIGHT="40">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="DivA" style="position:absolute;border:1px;font-size:1pt;top:-4px;left:-4px;height:40px;width:895px;z-index:5"><img alt="" src="images/filler_sm.jpg" height="33" width="1"></div>
<div class="DivA" style="position:absolute;border:1px;top:0px;left:0px;height:35px;width:895px;z-index:7">
	<font size="4" face=" Verdana, Arial, Times New Roman" style="filter:Shadow(color='#bdb76b');height:35;width:650">&nbsp;Armigers of Mirth&nbsp;<img src="images/banner.jpg" alt="The Armigers of Mirth" height="33" align="top">   Toasts!</font>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>

<center>
<table width="497px">
<tr>
<td><b><font size=2><img align=left src="images/beermug08.gif" alt="Cheers!" width=170 height=190> The return of the Toasts Page! Started way back in our early days of EverQuest©, we
see no reason not to keep up the tradition in Camelot!<p>

Every good drink should be accompanied with a good toast.
Here's a fun collection suited for battle, victories, new friends
and well wishing. We suggest setting up macros so you have an appropriate
toast when the occassion merits.<p>

Many of these (some with minor modifications) come from a great site, 
- <a target="_new" class="BaseC" href="http://faculty.umf.maine.edu/~donaghth/toasts.html">Tom's 
World--Sláinte! Toasts, Blessings, and Sayings.</a>
Special thanks to Tom Donaghue for giving us permission to use these!<p>
</font></td>
<td Class="MainB"><!--<img src="images/beermug08.gif" alt="Cheers!" width=170 height=190>--></td>
</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		In Vino Veritas<br>
		In Cervesio Felicitas<br>
		(In wine there is wisdom, In beer there is joy.)<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Slainte!<br>
		(Gaelic: To your health!)<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Céad Míle Fáilte!<br>
		(Gaelic: One hundred thousand welcomes!) <br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		The Gods invented Ale<br>
		to keep the Armigers from ruling Camelot.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Four blessings upon you...<br>
		Older whiskey<br>
		Younger women<br>
		Faster horses<br>
		More money <br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Here’s to a sweetheart, a bottle, and a friend.<br>
		The first beautiful, the second full, the last ever faithful.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		A toast to your coffin.<br>
		May it be made of 100 year old oak.<br>
		And may we plant the tree together, tomorrow. <br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Here`s to cheating, stealing, fighting, and drinking<br>
		If you cheat, may you cheat death.<br>
		If you steal, may you steal a woman`s heart.<br>
		If you fight, may you fight for a brother.<br>
		And if you drink, may you drink with me.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Here’s to a long life and a merry one.<br>
		A quick death and an easy one.<br>
		A pretty girl and an honest one.<br>
		A cold beer—and another one! <br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		For every wound, a balm.<br>
		For every sorrow, cheer.<br>
		For every storm, a calm.<br>
		For every thirst, a beer.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		May the winds of fortune sail you,<br>
		May you sail a gentle sea.<br>
		May it always be the other guy<br>
		who says, `this drink`s on me.`<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Who is a friend but someone to toast,<br>
		Someone to gibe, someone to roast.<br>
		My friends are the best friends<br>
		Loyal, willing and able.<br>
		Now let`s get to drinking!<br>
		Glasses off the table!<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		May misfortune follow you the rest of your life,<br>
		but never catch up.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Be one who drinks the finest of ales.<br>
		Every day without fail.<br>
		Even when you have drank enough,<br>
		Remember that ale is wonderful stuff.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Merry met, and merry part,<br>
		I drink to thee with all my heart.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Here`s to being single...<br>
		drinking doubles...<br>
		and seeing triple!<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		In all this world, why I do think<br>
		There are five reasons why we drink<br>
		Good friends,<br>
		good wine,<br>
		lest we be dry<br>
		and any other reason why.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		May your Guardian Angel be at your side to pick ya up off the floor<br>
		and hand ya another cold stout from the store<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><b>
		Bless you and yours<br>
		As well as the cottage you live in.<br>
		May the roof overhead be well thatched,<br>
		And those inside be well matched.<br>
		
		</b></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan=2 Class="MainB" align="center"><img src="images/arm_spear2.gif" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="26"></td>
	</tr>
	
</table>
</center>
